{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：19:00 2026-08-13 HKT</p>\n\n<p>伍富橋（Alvin）年與富家女梁兆楹（Shirley）結婚四年，將於今年10月迎來家庭新成員「伍梁液」。伍富橋今日（13日）在社交平台分享太太的孕照，以及二人的生活日常，伍富橋還寫上「倒數60日」，相信是BB出世的日子。</p>\n<h2>伍富橋太太性感打扮拍孕照</h2>\n<p>伍富橋今日在IG與太太放閃，化身「合法偷窺狂」拍下太太Shirley的惹火孕照，難掩準爸爸的激動心情。在伍富橋上載的短片中，見到他悄悄推開房門「突擊」愛妻，而Shirley當時正側躺在床上，上身僅穿黑色Bra Top，下半身則穿黑色絲質睡衣，大方展露豐滿上圍，以及圓渾的孕肚。</p>\n<p>另一張照片見到伍富橋與太太在浴室內一齊敷面膜，Shirley穿上啡色睡衣，僅扣胸前兩粒鈕扣，露出孕肚。其他的照片中，又見Shirley與老公伍富橋現身餐廳，不過Shirley露出委屈表情，未知是否遭到老公禁食。</p>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋太太Shirley預產期在今年10月。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/540c9089816ffa6d5eee531a08da30f6/2026-08/Alvin_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋太太Shirley還有大約兩個月便生產。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1375a0d382d4bab4836127be63ccf1ce/2026-08/Alvin_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋於2022年與富家女梁兆楹結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/689061b2f503f2b25fd611ee9955d13c/2024-05/sysleungx_1715170042_3363412552893182041_6235759.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與Shirley結婚4年，二人將榮升父母。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a02123fb7bc3ec35dce92d4cbd35d6a/2023-11/alvinngfukiu_1683477655_3097557538644450406_1281426289.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋分享與太太合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f22e055fff9fd1b4ecf60d22b98ff10/2026-08/Alvin_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋太太已懷孕約8個月。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dacd674618be928998298343b212dd34/2026-08/Alvin_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋透露太太卸貨進入倒數60日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97ef8b0895faadd711edf4aeeb44f79f/2026-08/Alvin_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋表示自己化身「合法偷窺狂」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2967985c15af0c22bea12a6eb55ea01/2026-08/Alvin_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋曝光太太的性感照，稱自己是「合法偷窺狂」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6cc027cc0a1ced284493c38a344dac5d/2026-08/Alvin_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋太太Shirley穿上性感裝束拍照，大晒惹火身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d47664ba141a60b6c347f61e391463d2/2026-08/Alvin_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋太太拍攝孕照，疑在酒店進行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41babe2132c4c613d03eb8a5df0ef1f2/2026-08/Alvin_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋的太太Shirley扁晒嘴，未知原因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a5d78c897cfc5074c453580b5570a07/2026-08/Alvin_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋太太Shirley半夜同愛犬玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d96cb33339723909363c472e7307cf5/2026-08/Alvin_30_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋晒出花絮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf7a86e05ac29d4e2847ca1191d975b5/2026-08/Alvin_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋透露推出新歌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a9d4b8a653d5bb887e3a6747c15083ed/2026-08/Alvin_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋攰到瞓睡著。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d75b70f591216051420383a820bb94cf/2026-08/Alvin_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋似乎好攰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d3ec42f9eb3c53ebb399a48e5aa42bcb/2026-08/Alvin_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋向傳媒大方承認即將榮升爸爸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7891a9010d508befaff468e23e2da678/2026-04/NG_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋留言表示：「最近接咗單大工程，預計10月完工。到時見啦，伍梁液。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8633870429e5b83762d90c8c69895375/2026-04/alvinngfukiu_1777107503_3882980483110455737_1281426289.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋透露太太梁兆楹懷孕喜訊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f4aace1553cb4b3fb1fcdc1e7b04e3a/2026-04/NG_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋今年5月舉行Baby Shower。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a13689e2eb5a4685a9441de3feb07c84/2026-05/Alvin_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"派對上處處見細節。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37c31bb778baf95ad8a9abd54b2805a0/2026-05/Alvin_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋在派對上才知道BB性別。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4829f062d57d0cb3754601353ad72154/2026-05/Alvin_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋夫婦與賓客合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/909af16c4acd5491fa2b698913d56825/2026-05/Alvin_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋見到小朋友已流露出慈父一面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4394f42868d6950f4c00dd49d8c45324/2026-05/Alvin_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋摸住太太孕肚合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f0d9374e8b8adfc66ba45f39b6a7533d/2026-05/Alvin_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋跟小朋友玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2b84b64c8f9a0fccbff1204c21324ed/2026-05/Alvin_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋學習照顧BB。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88eeb8288527cade2fa55de473893ad4/2026-05/Alvin_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋夫婦準備揭盅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46225f4d2df226265c8fa688654b1a2c/2026-05/Alvin_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場充斥藍色氣球。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c07618d5a9ae85e1d1e77c0a423f2dff/2026-05/Alvin_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋夫婦揭開BB是兒子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/137edf0475b7277a368c7dde12c4f1b6/2026-05/Alvin_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋自言仔女都沒所謂，但較喜歡女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44fd2d0bda2579061ce749418a829166/2026-05/Alvin_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋早前在凌晨4時跳舞慰妻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0afc45d4974de75e8577380ed653378/2026-04/NG_9__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋婚後大減工作量。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/322f300ecc5a80206a8b19d33ed7cdb4/2025-12/NG_4_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>伍富橋出單曲雙喜臨門</h2>\n<p>伍富橋即將榮升人父，又開心透露雙喜臨門，原來最近剛拍畢全新單曲《約定一起看未來》的MV，用音樂迎接人生新篇章。伍富橋在IG分享拍攝花絮：「《約定一起看未來》MV shooting，MV客串的小角色Howie小朋友，0700-2400」，可見生活充實。</p>\n<img alt=\"伍富已結婚4年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3988fb1addb66a5026970f33a3109386/2024-10/441112127_1344951736180869_2877843930581810894_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋婚後入住千呎豪宅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/171adf1b6ef7cae5d2544d7843a27706/2024-02/alvinngfukiu_1707565803_3299623570660855872_1281426289.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與梁兆楹去年為慶祝結婚三周年，拍攝一輯全新婚紗相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/66aae72c26aeca2e2111900d83850764/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_02_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與梁兆楹的3周年婚紗相，一絲不苟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08cc8cdc918ed6c9835984bd0cf07d08/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_08_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與梁兆楹的婚紗相，有歐洲童話氣息。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69c3e96e902923534723a321a8924594/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_07_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋夫婦挑選歐洲風格。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16327de9d5f9ffe28f500c9063994e0b/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_07_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋富貴妻梁兆楹的婚紗好典雅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ff98d5c631445348605642109c80286a/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_07_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹與伍富橋有如再辦一場婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82abcba9c9f75030b0cd203d36c78379/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_07_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋擁抱太太梁兆楹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10b0700b320e7f8b1d72b6732705d20e/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_06_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋太太梁兆楹換上另一款婚紗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9ec1b311f9f29e2e04831a23ff555ab/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_06_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹的婚紗以一字肩設計。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21fae70b937c210f9d8a0569190f1906/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_06_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與太太梁兆楹在綠悠悠的背景下拍照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad30d3031836b6ba584a011085fbd87d/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_05_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與太太梁兆楹的婚照，畫面非常好看。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cdaa32d152827bdee6853cfcb8711f93/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_06_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與太太梁兆楹有如置身婚禮現場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f04eef8c70a3556672eee4bf867f6b5/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_05_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹與伍富橋在相中非常甜蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17f60cf5dff62e6432ddbe0dc4b965fa/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_05_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹與伍富橋婚後經歷不少風雨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35784a2a367e372f89d0059094bdaec8/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_04_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋準備鑽戒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dbc085f7d3d2cb0b94f07082640584b1/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_04_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋的西裝下疑真空上陣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69fa2ce9eba7b8b47de87276f9abcd80/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_04_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋與梁兆楹為慶祝結婚周年花心思。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d033e4ff4f2dbbf98de05f3f57b4ceb/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_04_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹在相中形象大變，優雅且散發氣質。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be3940789cd0fea785a914f2cf7ec177/2025-05/WhatsApp_Image_2025-05-06_at_10_12_03_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"伍富橋老婆梁兆楹曾接受《晚吹—怨女俱樂部》訪問。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21fc3ec548e2a785a905a501d0af01f7/2025-06/VS---10XXViuTV-19_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹在訪談中提及成長經歷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26bac3db7b9e850a5a310c7b786d1c16/2025-06/VS---10XXViuTV-19_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹指她與伍富橋的婚姻不被父親接受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/02ee6968ed9225e46d557b0f65682148/2025-06/VS---10XXViuTV-19_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹年幼時的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c19093f3901440973ed0cb77b0e34305/2025-06/VS---10XXViuTV-4_59_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹年幼時的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be5e29c6355e7c943149509e18005dd5/2025-06/VS---10XXViuTV-4_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹認為有些網民留言是值得反思。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08d1e4e6012f0bed7dee6b07fb88f225/2025-06/VS---10XXViuTV-2_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹曾經出post反擊網民，直言自己當時不懂得怎樣處理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f322419cf93e6ddbf238b79c1e036ed1/2025-06/VS---10XXViuTV-1_58_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹曾經出post反擊網民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25a62b6fa1728f9fc2a833ee11f04a5a/2025-06/VS---10XXViuTV-1_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁兆楹笑言自己只是結婚，卻引起網民如此多批評。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82ed22f9dade1842beba131b6c86efb9/2025-06/VS---10XXViuTV-1_10_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T11:20:10.077259+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":531,"images":63,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}